  {
    "text": "mindfulness is not attention and",
    "start": 2108.32,
    "duration": 5.759
  },
  {
    "text": "mindfulness not synonymous. Mindfulness",
    "start": 2111.359,
    "duration": 4.881
  },
  {
    "text": "is broader",
    "start": 2114.079,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "not simply about the focus on an object.",
    "start": 2116.24,
    "duration": 10.72
  },
  {
    "text": "Also the kind of background",
    "start": 2121.839,
    "duration": 7.28
  },
  {
    "text": "could say",
    "start": 2126.96,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "you know the",
    "start": 2129.119,
    "duration": 8.48
  },
  {
    "text": "knowing epistemic context of one's",
    "start": 2132.64,
    "duration": 6.479
  },
  {
    "text": "object",
    "start": 2137.599,
    "duration": 4.961
  },
  {
    "text": "focused experience.",
    "start": 2139.119,
    "duration": 5.921
  },
  {
    "text": "The context of one's object focus",
    "start": 2142.56,
    "duration": 5.48
  },
  {
    "text": "experience.",
    "start": 2145.04,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And if you get too focused on a kind of",
    "start": 2148.16,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "tight connection with the object tends",
    "start": 2151.2,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "to generate a lot of tension and",
    "start": 2153.92,
    "duration": 4.4
  },
  {
    "text": "clinging. That's what I was saying like",
    "start": 2156.24,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "is it possible to lavish the object of",
    "start": 2158.32,
    "duration": 5.279
  },
  {
    "text": "attention",
    "start": 2161.28,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "um with a kind of rich brightness",
    "start": 2163.599,
    "duration": 7.641
  },
  {
    "text": "without reiterating the craving.",
    "start": 2166.48,
    "duration": 4.76
  },
  {
    "text": "Often that's not the case. Often our",
    "start": 2172.079,
    "duration": 7.121
  },
  {
    "text": "attention is a kind of appendage",
    "start": 2175.119,
    "duration": 7.601
  },
  {
    "text": "of our wanting.",
    "start": 2179.2,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "And so the Buddha says we begin with",
    "start": 2182.72,
    "duration": 4.639
  },
  {
    "text": "right view,",
    "start": 2185.04,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "a mind infused with letting go, with",
    "start": 2187.359,
    "duration": 7.881
  },
  {
    "text": "tranquility, with equinimity.",
    "start": 2191.2,
    "duration": 4.04
  },
  {
    "text": "And so it's possible to be very object",
    "start": 2197.04,
    "duration": 9.52
  },
  {
    "text": "focused but be animated by a lot of",
    "start": 2201.44,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "engineering and control",
    "start": 2206.56,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "and all the things we try to make happen",
    "start": 2209.44,
    "duration": 6.399
  },
  {
    "text": "even meditative things. It's like the",
    "start": 2212.4,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "these these um",
    "start": 2215.839,
    "duration": 7.601
  },
  {
    "text": "uh you know kind of",
    "start": 2218.88,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "often often something",
    "start": 2223.44,
    "duration": 7.2
  },
  {
    "text": "there's um control is masquerading as",
    "start": 2226.4,
    "duration": 7.24
  },
  {
    "text": "curiosity.",
    "start": 2230.64,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And the cue that we're trying to make",
    "start": 2235.2,
    "duration": 4.8
  },
  {
    "text": "something happen with our attention is",
    "start": 2237.68,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "where we're not relaxed.",
    "start": 2240.0,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "the kind of background",
    "start": 2243.52,
    "duration": 4.24
  },
  {
    "text": "contracts.",
    "start": 2246.0,
    "duration": 5.119
  },
  {
    "text": "The context of our knowing",
    "start": 2247.76,
    "duration": 6.359
  },
  {
    "text": "contracts",
    "start": 2251.119,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "and relaxation is we think of it as just",
    "start": 2254.64,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "like oh okay I want to be relaxed not",
    "start": 2258.32,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "not hyperaroused whatever but you cannot",
    "start": 2260.88,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "cling without tension",
    "start": 2264.56,
    "duration": 8.08
  },
  {
    "text": "and so relaxation runs deeper than mere",
    "start": 2268.4,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "kind of ease",
    "start": 2272.64,
    "duration": 7.08
  },
  {
    "text": "about letting know",
    "start": 2274.96,
    "duration": 4.76
  },
  {
    "text": "and awareness we could say is what that",
    "start": 2280.72,
    "duration": 5.84
  },
  {
    "text": "background context is what makes",
    "start": 2284.32,
    "duration": 4.56
  },
  {
    "text": "attention mindful.",
    "start": 2286.56,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "To be mindful means we're aware",
    "start": 2288.88,
    "duration": 9.959
  },
  {
    "text": "of how our attention is functioning.",
    "start": 2293.28,
    "duration": 5.559
  },
  {
    "text": "We're not merely attending. We're aware",
    "start": 2299.04,
    "duration": 7.92
  },
  {
    "text": "of how our attention is functioning.",
    "start": 2303.2,
    "duration": 6.0
  },
  {
    "text": "When we're we're just attentive, just",
    "start": 2306.96,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "trying to focus,",
    "start": 2309.2,
    "duration": 5.28
  },
  {
    "text": "we're not actually",
    "start": 2311.68,
    "duration": 6.159
  },
  {
    "text": "deeply aware of how our attention is",
    "start": 2314.48,
    "duration": 4.879
  },
  {
    "text": "functioning.",
    "start": 2317.839,
    "duration": 5.401
  },
  {
    "text": "We're aware of the object",
    "start": 2319.359,
    "duration": 3.881
  },
  {
    "text": "and that's fine. That's fine. A lot of",
    "start": 2323.92,
    "duration": 4.08
  },
  {
    "text": "what we do does not call for",
    "start": 2326.24,
    "duration": 4.56
  },
  {
    "text": "mindfulness. I would say we just trust",
    "start": 2328.0,
    "duration": 6.8
  },
  {
    "text": "the kind of information processing of",
    "start": 2330.8,
    "duration": 10.52
  },
  {
    "text": "our brain to do the job well.",
    "start": 2334.8,
    "duration": 6.52
  },
  {
    "text": "And so maybe we can say, and I'm just",
    "start": 2342.16,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "putting this together for myself, like",
    "start": 2346.32,
    "duration": 6.08
  },
  {
    "text": "maybe we can say that attention models",
    "start": 2348.88,
    "duration": 8.32
  },
  {
    "text": "the object, the breath for example,",
    "start": 2352.4,
    "duration": 8.32
  },
  {
    "text": "and awareness models the object and the",
    "start": 2357.2,
    "duration": 7.639
  },
  {
    "text": "mind knowing it.",
    "start": 2360.72,
    "duration": 4.119
  },
  {
    "text": "So",
    "start": 2369.2,
    "duration": 4.399
  },
  {
    "text": "we can experiment with how we're",
    "start": 2370.72,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "relating to an object, the breathing or",
    "start": 2373.599,
    "duration": 6.161
  },
  {
    "text": "whatever it might be.",
    "start": 2376.64,
    "duration": 5.52
  },
  {
    "text": "How much we're just attempting to have",
    "start": 2379.76,
    "duration": 5.599
  },
  {
    "text": "pure fidelity to that versus how much",
    "start": 2382.16,
    "duration": 6.16
  },
  {
    "text": "we're also checking the background",
    "start": 2385.359,
    "duration": 4.72
  },
  {
    "text": "context.",
    "start": 2388.32,
    "duration": 5.12
  },
  {
    "text": "how the attention is functioning,",
    "start": 2390.079,
    "duration": 8.121
  },
  {
    "text": "what control is being exerted",
    "start": 2393.44,
    "duration": 4.76
  },
  {
    "text": "and I I would associate samadei and",
    "start": 2399.04,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "concentration primarily with attention,",
    "start": 2401.68,
    "duration": 8.399
  },
  {
    "text": "primarily with the perception of a niche",
    "start": 2405.76,
    "duration": 6.72
  },
  {
    "text": "and I would associate awareness in the",
    "start": 2410.079,
    "duration": 4.961
  },
  {
    "text": "background context",
    "start": 2412.48,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "with mindfulness and the perception of",
    "start": 2415.04,
    "duration": 6.2
  },
  {
    "text": "anata.",
    "start": 2418.24,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "I'm saying too much",
    "start": 2421.359,
    "duration": 6.681
  },
  {
    "text": "for a dharmat",
    "start": 2424.0,
    "duration": 4.04
  },
  {
    "text": "but it's too late.",
    "start": 2430.24,
    "duration": 5.68
  },
  {
    "text": "So",
    "start": 2433.68,
    "duration": 6.32
  },
  {
    "text": "what we're uh what we're observing is",
    "start": 2435.92,
    "duration": 6.56
  },
  {
    "text": "different from how we're observing. What",
    "start": 2440.0,
    "duration": 4.16
  },
  {
    "text": "we're observing is different from how",
    "start": 2442.48,
    "duration": 4.16
  },
  {
    "text": "we're observing.",
    "start": 2444.16,
    "duration": 4.64
  },
  {
    "text": "And meditation is sometimes called",
    "start": 2446.64,
    "duration": 4.959
  },
  {
    "text": "attention training. It's about training",
    "start": 2448.8,
    "duration": 5.6
  },
  {
    "text": "the attention",
    "start": 2451.599,
    "duration": 8.321
  },
  {
    "text": "uh and and learning how craving shapes",
    "start": 2454.4,
    "duration": 8.48
  },
  {
    "text": "the movements of the mind and the",
    "start": 2459.92,
    "duration": 8.84
  },
  {
    "text": "construction of the world and self.",
    "start": 2462.88,
    "duration": 5.88
  },
  {
    "text": "There's no one place to look or crave",
    "start": 2471.68,
    "duration": 5.2
  },
  {
    "text": "it.",
    "start": 2474.48,
    "duration": 5.839
  },
  {
    "text": "There's subtlety that's needed.",
    "start": 2476.88,
    "duration": 8.4
  },
  {
    "text": "We can't just attend to one thing to see",
    "start": 2480.319,
    "duration": 7.52
  },
  {
    "text": "if there's craving.",
    "start": 2485.28,
    "duration": 7.36
  },
  {
    "text": "Mindfulness needs to be open open to the",
    "start": 2487.839,
    "duration": 7.121
  },
  {
    "text": "kind of gravitational effects of",
    "start": 2492.64,
    "duration": 5.32
  },
  {
    "text": "craving.",
    "start": 2494.96,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "And we practice deeply allowing the",
    "start": 2498.8,
    "duration": 9.519
  },
  {
    "text": "arising of craving of aversion.",
    "start": 2503.04,
    "duration": 8.16
  },
  {
    "text": "And to allow craving and aversion is not",
    "start": 2508.319,
    "duration": 5.921
  },
  {
    "text": "to acquies to them. The allowing",
    "start": 2511.2,
    "duration": 8.0
  },
  {
    "text": "takes the thorns out of the clinging.",
    "start": 2514.24,
    "duration": 8.96
  },
  {
    "text": "In other words, by clinging depends",
    "start": 2519.2,
    "duration": 7.96
  },
  {
    "text": "on doing it unconsciously.",
    "start": 2523.2,
    "duration": 3.96
  },
  {
    "text": "And when the awareness is there, the",
    "start": 2527.599,
    "duration": 6.401
  },
  {
    "text": "clinging becomes an object rather than a",
    "start": 2530.88,
    "duration": 6.12
  },
  {
    "text": "commandment.",
    "start": 2534.0,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "Awareness",
    "start": 2540.48,
    "duration": 5.56
  },
  {
    "text": "cannot cling.",
    "start": 2542.56,
    "duration": 3.48
  },
  {
    "text": "If it's clinging, it's not awareness.",
    "start": 2547.52,
    "duration": 4.599
  },
  {
    "text": "Attention",
    "start": 2553.839,
    "duration": 6.28
  },
  {
    "text": "can cling. Seems to me",
    "start": 2555.359,
    "duration": 4.76
  },
  {
    "text": "as soon as we begin clinging the the",
    "start": 2562.0,
    "duration": 5.04
  },
  {
    "text": "attention",
    "start": 2565.44,
    "duration": 7.12
  },
  {
    "text": "fixates an object, reifies it,",
    "start": 2567.04,
    "duration": 8.52
  },
  {
    "text": "differentiates.",
    "start": 2572.56,
    "duration": 3.0
  },
  {
    "text": "We begin strategizing.",
    "start": 2575.599,
    "duration": 7.641
  },
  {
    "text": "There's no strategy in awareness.",
    "start": 2578.64,
    "duration": 4.6
  },
  {
    "text": "In other words, um,",
    "start": 2585.28,
    "duration": 7.76
  },
  {
    "text": "a moment of mindfulness is",
    "start": 2588.72,
    "duration": 9.76
  },
  {
    "text": "from one perspective is very ordinary.",
    "start": 2593.04,
    "duration": 9.92
  },
  {
    "text": "From another perspective is quite free.",
    "start": 2598.48,
    "duration": 7.879
  },
  {
    "text": "Quite free.",
    "start": 2602.96,
    "duration": 3.399
  },
  {
    "text": "Offer this for your consideration.",
    "start": 2607.92,
    "duration": 6.24
  },
  {
    "text": "Uh, yeah. Please uh pick up what's",
    "start": 2611.119,
    "duration": 6.48
  },
  {
    "text": "useful. leave the rest behind.",
    "start": 2614.16,
    "duration": 6.159
  },
  {
    "text": "I um",
    "start": 2617.599,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "put a link for um for questions. If you",
    "start": 2620.319,
    "duration": 4.961
  },
  {
    "text": "have questions",
    "start": 2623.359,
    "duration": 4.801
  },
  {
    "text": "uh to submit, maybe next next week I'll",
    "start": 2625.28,
    "duration": 5.76
  },
  {
    "text": "uh try to respond to to something that",
    "start": 2628.16,
    "duration": 4.88
  },
  {
    "text": "someone asked. So that's in the",
    "start": 2631.04,
    "duration": 5.92
  },
  {
    "text": "description uh in on YouTube.",
    "start": 2633.04,
    "duration": 7.92
  },
  {
    "text": "And um I wish you all a good week and uh",
    "start": 2636.96,
    "duration": 7.6
  },
  {
    "text": "it's been good to be with you. And uh",
    "start": 2640.96,
    "duration": 7.96
  },
  {
    "text": "see you uh see you next time.",
    "start": 2644.56,
    "duration": 4.36
  }
]